// Danger and action (docs/design/music.md, section 7b; crates/humanity-music/src/intensity.rs). The game
// sets an intensity, 0..1 (a hull breach, a meteor storm, an invasion, combat; today the Dev page's
// slider and the "music_intensity" showcase verb). Each band names the mood it plays (none: the place's
// own, so calm is wherever you are). Rising into a band: the stinger on the next beat, the riser to the
// next bar line, the danger mood from that bar. Falling: at the next fall_bars boundary, quietly.
IntensityMap(
    bands: [
        (from: 0.0),
        (from: 0.35, mood: Some("tension")),
        (from: 0.7, mood: Some("action")),
    ],
    hysteresis: 0.08,
    stinger: [
        (instrument: "taiko_hit", note: "D2", velocity: 1.0),
        (instrument: "celesta", note: "D6", velocity: 0.8),
        (instrument: "celesta", note: "A5", velocity: 0.7, beat: 0.5),
    ],
    riser: Some((instrument: "riser", note: "D4", velocity: 0.8)),
    fall_bars: 2,
)
